From 80c5624e8d76bd347ba0c570d22241ab51102b5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:53:34 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Gui: the stereo 3D view's sentences in ten languages

Sparky Stereo OS: the twelve sentences of the stereo 3D view (Enable 3D and
3D Display Settings with their tooltips, the seven sentences told in the
report view, and the Python API's refusal of the program's own stereo
outputs) in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Spanish (es-ES and
es-AR), Japanese, Korean and Chinese (Simplified and Traditional).  The seven
told sentences are the edition's own, as OpenSCAD's catalogue has them.
A first draft with AI assistance, pending review by native speakers.

Forwarded: not-needed (the edition's build)
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic)
